# screenshot scratch in the working tree.
# `/*.png` is ROOT-ONLY on purpose — that is where stray screenshots land, and
# the two PNGs the site actually ships (apple-touch-icon, favicon-32) live under
# public/ and stay tracked. An unignored image in the root of a public repo that
# auto-deploys is how the 2026-07-26 incident started; the narrower `cc-*.png`
# below did not catch a file named anything else.
/*.png
cc-*.png

